#: src/window.rs:45
msgid ""
"On Windows on ARM, the OpenGL that Spotifast draws with comes from "
"Microsoft's OpenCL, OpenGL & Vulkan Compatibility Pack. Open its Microsoft "
"Store page to install or repair it?"
msgstr ""
"I Windows på ARM kommer OpenGL, som Spotifast ritar med, från Microsofts "
"OpenCL, OpenGL & Vulkan Compatibility Pack. Öppna dess sida i Microsoft "
"Store för att installera eller reparera det?"

#. Translators: Keep {url} exactly as written. It becomes the address
#. of the Spotifast download page.
#: src/window.rs:55
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Spotifast needs a graphics driver with OpenGL 2.0 or newer, and this PC or "
"virtual machine does not provide one. Install the graphics driver, or turn "
"on GPU acceleration for the virtual machine. Open {url} to read more?"
msgstr ""
"Spotifast behöver en grafikdrivrutin med OpenGL 2.0 eller senare, och den "
"här datorn eller virtuella maskinen har ingen. Installera grafikdrivrutinen "
"eller slå på GPU-acceleration för den virtuella maskinen. Öppna {url} för "
"att läsa mer?"

